  "idea": "Command lifecycle hooks for Ensemble: a logical command lifecycle (command.start / command.end, with outcome succeeded|failed|cancelled, run_id, one event per concrete command with dispatchers resolved first) with two handler types, shell and prompt, configured by a project-level .ensemble/hooks.yaml (reusable handlers plus per-command start/end selection, explicit type and on_error, separate hooks schema and validator), run serially, exposed through harness adapters that declare capabilities (command_start, command_end, command_end_on_cancel) rather than approximating command end with Claude session/turn events; open decision: runtime-owned command wrapper vs adapter-specific best-effort lifecycle.",
